OL,3,AShadow chancellor to unveil Tory plans
OL,4,Ato cut taxes and regulations
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother prospective policy is replacing
OL,7,Fagreements designed to compel
OL,8,Fdevelopers to fund community projects
OL,9,Fand services in areas they want to
OL,10,Fbuild.
OL,12,FGriffith will describe his approach as
OL,13,Fthe "most ambitious deregulation
OL,14,Fproject in a generation". Reform UK
OL,15,Fsuggested the Tories were "copying our
OL,16,Fpolicies".
